# Multitasking P-d (task 015-pd): the legacy app sheet (study 6.2, D12) after a three-finger hold in an app that cannot
# stay in the background. The screen shown before (the Calculator here) stands for the app's last frame: the launcher
# keeps it (snapshot), writes it back dimmed to 38 % (cp0_display_fb_backdrop) and draws only the sheet's box over it
# (the native clip). The "sheet" command checks every pixel: outside the box the dimmed frame, inside the sheet.
# Checked too: Keep and Close at least 7 mm, Keep and Close by touch (Close at the corner of its target), Esc = Keep.
title multitask legacy sheet
sizes 640x480 800x480 720x720 1280x720 1024x600
@1024x600 ppmm 660
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator viz1090=tank_100.png
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
launch Calculator
sheet viz1090
shot sheet_viz1090
expect_targets
tapitem keep
expect_event keep
tapitem sheetclose edge
expect_event sheet-close
key ESC
expect_event keep
key BACKSPACE
expect_event keep
sheet off
sheet Spectrum Analyzer for the Software Defined Radio
shot sheet_long_name
sheet off
